  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment UNDP Somalia through FBA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekundering UNDP Somalia via FBA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FNS Resident Coordinator Office (RCO) f&#xf6;r Somalia har beg&#xe4;rt en       sekundering fr&#xe5;n Sida 2013-2014. Under de senaste m&#xe5;naderna har        det skett en &#xf6;kad efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; RCO att fr&#xe4;mja utvecklingen av      gemensamma program f&#xf6;r Somalia och st&#xf6;dja inr&#xe4;ttandet av gemensamma   tj&#xe4;nster inom FN och partners, och st&#xf6;dja bredare samordning av       aktiviteter med den federala regeringen.FBA rekryterar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Resident Coordinator Office(RCO)for Somalia has requested a    secondment from Sida 2013-2014, through FBA. In recent months there   has been an increased demand on the RCO to promote the development of joint programmes for Somalia and support the establishment of common  services within the UN and partners, and to support the broader       broader coordination of activities with the federal government.</narrative>
  </description>
